From cc6bacd7c764f3fe97800bf59dd8f7d539323c7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 22:27:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/49] x86_64/k1om: regenerate the abilists

Intel's k1om abilists are copies of the x86_64 ones and list symbol
versions older than GLIBC_2.14, the k1om baseline in shlib-versions, so
check-abi failed for every library.  Regenerated with make update-abi;
the exported symbol sets are identical to those of the MPSS 3.8.6
libraries.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
